WEBVTT

00:08:27.639 --> 00:08:31.192
as part of a research study
with Karissa Burnett and Jennifer Allen.

00:08:32.127 --> 00:08:35.663
And Jennifer Allen is the woman
who coined the term

00:08:35.663 --> 00:08:39.017
Autonomous Sensory
Meridian Response in 2010.

00:08:40.268 --> 00:08:44.456
And what we see
is that ASMR is experienced

00:08:44.456 --> 00:08:46.925
in over 130 different countries.

00:08:48.026 --> 00:08:50.462
And the people are reporting
the same experience.

00:08:50.695 --> 00:08:52.230
They feel deeply relaxed.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:55.333
They have these special,
light brain tingles.

00:08:56.067 --> 00:08:59.037
And it’s helping them
to fall asleep more easily,

00:08:59.037 --> 00:09:01.139
and it’s helping them
to reduce their stress.